  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n感谢你特意前来。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A611F8C224F607279610F524D67653002001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请你看一下这个。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF74F60770B4E004E0B8FD94E2A3002001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这个是？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94E2A662FFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "球？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7403FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这只宝可梦叫做玛机雅娜，\n是由500多年以前的人<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n制作出来的宝可梦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD953EA5B9D53EF68A653EB505A739B673A96C55A1CFF0C000A662F7531003500300030591A5E744EE5524D76844EBA00100001BE00000A52364F5C51FA676576845B9D53EF68A63002001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我们在都市开发的过程中发现了它，\n但它好像正处于休眠状态……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114EEC572890FD5E025F0053D176848FC77A0B4E2D53D173B04E865B83FF0C000A4F465B83597D50CF6B6359044E8E4F11772072B6600120262026001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要想让它醒来，必须要\n向它内部的装置传送能量。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "898160F38BA95B8391926765FF0C5FC5987B8981000A54115B83518590E8768488C57F6E4F20900180FD91CF3002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为此就需要用到\n玛机雅娜专用的超级石。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A6B645C319700898175285230000A739B673A96C55A1C4E13752876848D857EA777F33002001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然我已经委托AZ他\n来帮忙制作了，但是……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n超级石还是会由我们\n阔星公司负责准备好。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D713662115DF27ECF59D462580041005A4ED6000A67655E2E5FD952364F5C4E86FF0C4F46662F2026202600100001BE01000A8D857EA777F38FD8662F4F1A753162114EEC000A9614661F516C53F88D1F8D2351C65907597D3002001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n精练超级石需要用到<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>999个超级碎片<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n能请你帮我准备一下吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A7CBE7EC38D857EA777F3970089817528523000100002FF0000060039003900394E2A8D857EA7788E724700100002FF000000FF0C00100001BE00000A80FD8BF74F605E2E621151C659074E004E0B5417FF1F001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "休眠状态的玛机雅娜。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F11772072B660017684739B673A96C55A1C30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n精练超级石需要用到<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>999个超级碎片<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n请你帮我准备一下吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 14,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A7CBE7EC38D857EA777F3970089817528523000100002FF0000060039003900394E2A8D857EA7788E724700100002FF000000FF0C00100001BE00000A8BF74F605E2E621151C659074E004E0B54273002001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n我可以收下这些超级碎片吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A621153EF4EE565364E0B8FD94E9B8D857EA7788E72475417FF1F001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请收下吧",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF765364E0B54270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF77B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀？\n是有什么情况吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440FF1F000A662F67094EC04E4860C551B55417FF1F001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>交出了\n999个超级碎片！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000004EA451FA4E86000A0039003900394E2A8D857EA7788E7247FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "感谢你帮忙收集。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "611F8C224F605E2E5FD9653696C63002001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那么我这就来为玛机雅娜\n精炼超级石。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E4862118FD95C3167654E3A739B673A96C55A1C000A7CBE70BC8D857EA777F33002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这是玛机雅娜专用的超级石，\n玛机雅娜进化石。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD9662F739B673A96C55A1C4E13752876848D857EA777F3FF0C000A739B673A96C55A1C8FDB531677F33002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那么就请通过超级环的钥石\n来为玛机雅娜传送能量吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E485C318BF7901A8FC78D857EA773AF768494A577F3000A67654E3A739B673A96C55A1C4F20900180FD91CF54273002001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……噗咻。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "20262026565754BB30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀！\n它醒过来了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440FF01000A5B8391928FC767654E863002001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真是太好了……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F662F592A597D4E8620262026001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n就请你将这个世界的美好之处<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n告诉一直在沉睡的玛机雅娜吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A5C318BF74F605C068FD94E2A4E16754C76847F8E597D4E4B590400100001BE00000A544A8BC94E0076F457286C8977617684739B673A96C55A1C54273002001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>获得了\n玛机雅娜！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000083B75F974E86000A739B673A96C55A1CFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀……\n你的盒子满了呀。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE544020262026000A4F60768476D25B506EE14E8654403002001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就拜托你好好照顾玛机雅娜了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C3162DC62584F60597D597D7167987E739B673A96C55A1C4E863002001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "另外也请收下这个超级石吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53E659164E5F8BF765364E0B8FD94E2A8D857EA777F354273002001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n连带<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>一起，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n今后也请多关照了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 11,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A8FDE5E2600100002018B00014E008D77FF0C00100001BE00000A4ECA540E4E5F8BF7591A517371674E863002001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果能感受到自己与其他人的联系，\n便会产生对那座城市的依恋。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
